  "name": "Replete",
  "description": "A worker the nest filled up and stopped sending anywhere — the honeypot caste, kept as a larder until something needs feeding. The first cut drew that as one round sac, which put it in a silhouette the Mite and the Bulwark already own: this roster cannot afford a third ball. It is a chain instead. Four swellings of falling size, pinched between each other, hauled by a front end that still has legs — and the back half has none, because that half is not walking, it is being dragged. Pale shell with the amber it is holding showing through each bead, so the whole length reads as full rather than as one bright spot. In a 130px passage a body that long across the floor is not an obstacle you get past, and that is the design. Drawn facing +x, the game flips it. Gameplay radius 13.",
